  "summary_zh": "從史科嘉瀑布，旁邊的步道走上，當你走上步到起，步行 20-30 分鐘左右， 你會接連看到 3 個小瀑布，蠻值得一來的。\n\n在這上面，步行 20 分鐘內，你會看到三個瀑布 - 馬渡瀑布、福斯托爾瀑布、石拱瀑布，如果你旅行時間較為彈性，我蠻推薦走上來看看的，你會發現史科嘉瀑布上游是這景觀。\n\n這三個瀑布都離的很近，都蠻值得一看。",
  "summary_en": "From Skógá waterfall, take the adjacent trail upward. After about 20–30 minutes of walking, you will see three small waterfalls in succession, which are well worth a visit. Within a 20‑minute walk you will encounter the three waterfalls – Mávárfoss, Fósárfoss, and Steinbogafoss. If you have flexible travel time, I highly recommend hiking up to see them; you’ll discover that upstream of Skógá waterfall lies this scenery. All three waterfalls are close together and definitely worth seeing.",
